      "name": "PRANA Meet the Founder",
      "settings": {
        "eyebrow": "The Founder",
        "heading": "Where Ayurveda meets <em>modern science.</em>",
        "intro": "Blending a background in technology with a lifelong Ayurvedic inheritance — Prabha Iyer built PRANA to make ancient ritual as precise as anything she'd shipped in tech.",
        "quote": "\"I carried a lifelong belief in the healing power of nature — a gift from my Ayurvedic roots. I decided to create something better.\"",
        "founder_name": "Prabha Iyer",
        "founder_role": "Founder, PRANA Beauty & Wellness",
        "story": "<p>As an immigrant in New York, Prabha Iyer found mainstream skincare full of harsh chemicals and synthetic fragrances that didn't align with what she'd known since childhood. <strong>So she went back to the source</strong> — ethically sourced, all-natural Ayurvedic ingredients like saffron, turmeric, and sandalwood, paired with modern, science-backed formulation. Every batch is made small, to maximize potency and preserve purity.</p><p>In 2025, PRANA integrated AI-powered facial skin analysis into the ritual itself — reading skin tone, texture, and hydration, then mapping the result to Ayurvedic dosha balance to recommend the exact routine each woman needs.</p><p>As a mother navigating both motherhood and entrepreneurship, Prabha built PRANA on one belief: the most powerful beauty is the kind that doesn't demand compromise — on health, on ingredients, or on identity.</p>",
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/gempages_546167947945575666-2df11a2e-7481-4440-8167-e74c3da00d13.png",
        "video": "shopify://files/videos/7221de0752ba46579bc87105e5f783c5.mp4",
        "location": "Jersey City, NJ",
        "film_caption": "Watch the brand film"
      }
    },
