        "ingredient_jnCLHN": {
          "type": "ingredient",
          "name": "Triphala",
          "settings": {
            "tab_name": "Triphala",
            "ingredient_title": "Triphala",
            "ingredient_subtitle": "Terminalia Chebula + Terminalia Bellerica + Emblica Officinalis",
            "description": "<p>Triphala — \"three fruits\" — is the most celebrated compound formulation in Ayurvedic medicine: an equal combination of <em>Haritaki</em>, <em>Bibhitaki</em>, and <em>Amalaki</em>. As a topical, it provides <strong>synergistic antioxidant, antimicrobial, and brightening activity</strong> that exceeds any single component. All three fruits appear individually in PRANA's Saffron Glow Face Oil INCI — their combined effect producing a brightening complex of exceptional depth.</p>",
            "info_1_title": "Haritaki",
            "info_1_text": "Chebulagic acid and chebulinic acid provide potent antioxidant and antimicrobial activity. Classified as the \"king of medicines\" in Tibetan and Ayurvedic traditions.",
            "info_2_title": "Bibhitaki",
            "info_2_text": "Gallic acid and ellagic acid from Terminalia bellerica inhibit tyrosinase and provide anti-inflammatory and astringent effects.",
            "info_3_title": "Synergistic Effect",
            "info_3_text": "The combination of all three fruits produces antioxidant activity greater than the sum of parts — the documented synergistic effect that gives Triphala its unique position in Ayurvedic formulation.",
            "info_4_title": "",
            "info_4_text": "",
            "info_5_title": "",
            "info_5_text": "",
            "product_tags": "Saffron Glow Face Oil"
          }
        },
        "ingredient_XKATyH": {
          "type": "ingredient",
          "name": "Blue Lotus",
          "settings": {
            "tab_name": "Blue Lotus",
            "ingredient_title": "Blue Lotus",
            "ingredient_subtitle": "Nymphaea Caerulea Flower Extract",
            "description": "<p>Blue Lotus — <em>Utpala</em> in Sanskrit — was sacred in ancient Egypt, revered in Buddhist iconography, and documented in Ayurvedic texts for its skin-cooling and brightening properties. Its <strong>nuciferine alkaloids and rich flavonoid profile</strong> provide antioxidant, anti-inflammatory, and mild tyrosinase-inhibiting activity. In PRANA's face oil, it adds a rare, luminous quality — both in the aromatic experience and in the finished skin effect.</p>",
            "info_1_title": "Antioxidant",
            "info_1_text": "Quercetin, kaempferol, and myricetin in Blue Lotus extract provide broad-spectrum antioxidant protection with particular affinity for preventing lipid peroxidation.",
            "info_2_title": "Brightening",
            "info_2_text": "Flavonoids demonstrate inhibitory activity against tyrosinase in vitro — contributing to the brightening complex alongside saffron and amla.",
            "info_3_title": "Cooling & Soothing",
            "info_3_text": "Pitta-pacifying in classical classification. Modern evidence: anti-inflammatory alkaloids reduce skin reactivity and provide a cooling sensation perception.",
            "info_4_title": "",
            "info_4_text": "",
            "info_5_title": "",
            "info_5_text": "",
            "product_tags": "Saffron Glow Face Oil"
          }
        },
        "ingredient_8P3NVK": {
          "type": "ingredient",
          "name": "Rose Water",
          "settings": {
            "tab_name": "Rose Water",
            "ingredient_title": "Pure Rose Water",
            "ingredient_subtitle": "Rosa Damascena Flower Water",
            "description": "<p>Pure Rose Water — <em>Gulab Jal</em> — is the hydrosol produced by steam distillation of Damask rose petals. It is distinct from rose-scented water (water with synthetic fragrance) and from rose oil (the concentrated lipid extract). The true hydrosol contains <strong>water-soluble phenylethanol, geraniol, and linalool</strong> at therapeutic concentrations. Its pH of 5.0–5.5 precisely matches the skin's acid mantle — making it the ideal toning medium in the PRANA ritual.</p>",
            "info_1_title": "pH Restoration",
            "info_1_text": "Cleansing disrupts the skin's acid mantle (pH 4.5–5.5). Rose water immediately restores the optimal pH environment for barrier function and microbiome balance.",
            "info_2_title": "Absorption Priming",
            "info_2_text": "Applied before a serum or oil, rose water temporarily increases skin hydration and permeability — improving penetration of subsequently applied actives.",
            "info_3_title": "Anti-inflammatory Mist",
            "info_3_text": "Phenylethanol and geraniol in the hydrosol reduce transient redness and reactivity — providing immediate visual calming upon application.",
            "info_4_title": "",
            "info_4_text": "",
            "info_5_title": "",
            "info_5_text": "",
            "product_tags": "Pure Rose Water Toning Mist, Rose Jasmine Milk Cleanser"
          }
        },
        "ingredient_N7pfMT": {
          "type": "ingredient",
          "name": "Kaolin Clay",
          "settings": {
            "tab_name": "Kaolin Clay",
            "ingredient_title": "Kaolin Clay",
            "ingredient_subtitle": "Kaolin / Illite",
            "description": "<p>Kaolin is a white aluminosilicate clay — the gentlest of the cosmetic clays, appropriate for all skin types including sensitive and dry. Its <strong>adsorptive and absorptive dual action</strong> draws excess sebum and surface impurities to the clay matrix while simultaneously delivering trace minerals including silica, zinc, and magnesium. In PRANA's purifying mask, kaolin and French green illite create a dual-clay base that clarifies without stripping — preserving the skin's natural lipid balance.</p>",
            "info_1_title": "Adsorption",
            "info_1_text": "Kaolin's highly charged platelet structure adsorbs sebum, environmental particulate matter, and dead skin cells from the surface — providing a deep physical cleanse without aggressive surfactants.",
            "info_2_title": "Mineral Delivery",
            "info_2_text": "Kaolin and illite deliver bioavailable silica, magnesium, calcium, and zinc — trace minerals that support enzyme function, barrier repair, and wound healing.",
            "info_3_title": "Gentle Exfoliation",
            "info_3_text": "The micro-platelet structure provides mild physical exfoliation during rinse-off — removing dead skin cells without the microtear risk of abrasive physical scrubs.",
            "info_4_title": "",
            "info_4_text": "",
            "info_5_title": "",
            "info_5_text": "",
            "product_tags": "Turmeric & Sandalwood Purifying Mask"
          }
        },
        "ingredient_WigyiR": {
          "type": "ingredient",
          "name": "Squalane",
          "settings": {
            "tab_name": "Squalane",
            "ingredient_title": "Plant-Derived Squalane",
            "ingredient_subtitle": "Squalane (Sugarcane-derived)",
            "description": "<p>Squalane is a <strong>skin-identical lipid</strong> — a molecule that the skin itself produces as a component of sebum, declining significantly after age 30. Derived from sugarcane in PRANA's formulas (never shark liver), plant-derived squalane absorbs completely within 30 seconds, leaving no residue. It is the base carrier in the Bakuchiol Night Restorative Serum — chosen because its skin-identical chemistry maximises penetration of bakuchiol and supporting actives without competition from a heavier carrier oil.</p>",
            "info_1_title": "Skin-Identical Hydration",
            "info_1_text": "Because squalane is structurally identical to a component of human sebum, absorption is immediate and complete across all skin types — no adaptation required.",
            "info_2_title": "Barrier Occlusion",
            "info_2_text": "A thin film of squalane reduces transepidermal water loss without blocking pores — providing overnight hydration retention to support repair processes during sleep.",
            "info_3_title": "Antioxidant Stability",
            "info_3_text": "Squalane is inherently resistant to lipid peroxidation — it does not oxidise on skin as many plant oils do, providing passive antioxidant protection.",
            "info_4_title": "Universal Compatibility",
            "info_4_text": "Non-comedogenic, fragrance-free, appropriate for all skin types including acne-prone, rosacea, and sensitised skin. The one carrier oil without contraindications.",
            "info_5_title": "",
            "info_5_text": "",
            "product_tags": "Bakuchiol Night Restorative Serum"
          }
        }
      },
