            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Blue_lotus_image_b7efa3a8-7a9f-4404-9b21-946e0484809e.png",
            "description": "Sacred in both ancient Egyptian and Ayurvedic traditions as a symbol of luminosity and enlightenment. Blue lotus flower extract is rich in flavonoids including quercetin and kaempferol — potent antioxidants that protect against oxidative stress-induced pigmentation while imparting a natural luminosity at the surface. In the classical Kumkumadi formula, blue lotus is the note of radiance that saffron amplifies.",
            "accordion_1_title": "Antioxidant",
